{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mini Royale: The Ultimate Toy Soldier Shooter!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini Royale</strong> elevates the beloved toy soldier experience with creative weapons, gadgets, and dynamic movement. Swing from curtain rods, dodge between towering action figures, and zip across the room using the game\u2019s signature grapple gun. Every match offers fresh and exciting ways to outmaneuver your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657090/extras/MapFlight_Short_3.gif?t=1743101018\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Battle Royale:</strong> Engage in an action-packed free-for-all where you fight to be the last soldier or team standing. Traverse chaotic, larger-than-life environments, making every match a new adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Color Conquest:</strong> Take on three other teams in a nostalgic twist on classic toy soldier battles. Eliminate enemy players to convert them to your team\u2019s color until only one color remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong> Deathmatch:</strong> Enter tightly packed arenas like the inside of a pinball machine, a sandbox, or a moving box filled with toys. Prove yourself as the ultimate deathmatch champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">... and more to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657090/extras/Combat_Full.gif?t=1743101018\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master a fluid movement system designed for quick, responsive action. Whether <strong>sliding</strong> down slopes, <strong>grappling</strong> into the air, <strong>parachuting</strong> into battle, or <strong>scaling</strong> any surface, every maneuver offers a unique edge in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657090/extras/Movement_Opt.gif?t=1743101018\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Express yourself on the battlefield! Choose from a wide array of cosmetics, including: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skins:</strong> Transform your toy soldier into a unique combatant. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Emotes:</strong> Celebrate your victories with style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gliders &amp; Melee Weapons:</strong> Add flair to every move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Voicelines:</strong> Personalize your loadout and stand out in the crowd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657090/extras/Wardrobe.gif?t=1743101018\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join Our Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re a passionate indie team crafting Mini Royale with love and creativity. Your feedback is crucial in shaping the future of the game. Join our vibrant community on Discord and be part of the journey!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Toy Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1657090/619358712bbaa960cc2b0f6661f2f3feb4adb536.jpg"},{"name":"Rookie Rumble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1657090/2941f31c6d231a2150a680aec661e7ed809c16a5.jpg"},{"name":"Rookie Riot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1657090/cd3ff534f44ec4266ac64731af04e3eee77a4e0b.jpg"},{"name":"Top Toy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1657090/0f1803ee124b7fa7931d6ca1de96593ebb8f9a28.jpg"},{"name":"Polished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1657090/e72a367312fe0ffdafe3ad3113888489842920b1.jpg"},{"name":"Toy Sniper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1657090/8b10f46225543c3b667bb2a49c3742f26d50de02.jpg"},{"name":"Playful Marksman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1657090/8e4334b62ce75a357be1d36293b0a4f37058adb5.jpg"},{"name":"Unstoppable Force","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1657090/be6d82b22b6c6e9a9e76fb4eadfc84955fe56376.jpg"},{"name":"Survivalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1657090/4135c3e9f9ec29baf71d91c46a92fa28677f6d68.jpg"},{"name":"Pyrotechnics Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1657090/265a3fadef8ee4b362f9cb9e0bc670f2e19a8951.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1657090?t=1743101018","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1657090?t=1743101018","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743101018","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657090/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743101018","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Be a part of a growing community by joining our Discord</h1><p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657090/extras/Steam_Mini_Royale_Discord_Banner.gif?t=1743101018\" /></p><br><h1>Please wishlist the game and follow to support us</h1><p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657090/extras/Steam_Mini_Royale_Wishlist_Banner.gif?t=1743101018\" /></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mini Royale: The Ultimate Toy Soldier Shooter!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini Royale</strong> elevates the beloved toy soldier experience with creative weapons, gadgets, and dynamic movement. Swing from curtain rods, dodge between towering action figures, and zip across the room using the game\u2019s signature grapple gun. Every match offers fresh and exciting ways to outmaneuver your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657090/extras/MapFlight_Short_3.gif?t=1743101018\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Battle Royale:</strong> Engage in an action-packed free-for-all where you fight to be the last soldier or team standing. Traverse chaotic, larger-than-life environments, making every match a new adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Color Conquest:</strong> Take on three other teams in a nostalgic twist on classic toy soldier battles. Eliminate enemy players to convert them to your team\u2019s color until only one color remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong> Deathmatch:</strong> Enter tightly packed arenas like the inside of a pinball machine, a sandbox, or a moving box filled with toys. Prove yourself as the ultimate deathmatch champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">... and more to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657090/extras/Combat_Full.gif?t=1743101018\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master a fluid movement system designed for quick, responsive action. Whether <strong>sliding</strong> down slopes, <strong>grappling</strong> into the air, <strong>parachuting</strong> into battle, or <strong>scaling</strong> any surface, every maneuver offers a unique edge in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657090/extras/Movement_Opt.gif?t=1743101018\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Express yourself on the battlefield! Choose from a wide array of cosmetics, including: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skins:</strong> Transform your toy soldier into a unique combatant. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Emotes:</strong> Celebrate your victories with style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gliders &amp; Melee Weapons:</strong> Add flair to every move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Voicelines:</strong> Personalize your loadout and stand out in the crowd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657090/extras/Wardrobe.gif?t=1743101018\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join Our Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re a passionate indie team crafting Mini Royale with love and creativity. Your feedback is crucial in shaping the future of the game. Join our vibrant community on Discord and be part of the journey!</p>","developers":["IndigoBlue"],"dlc":[3329230],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1657090/header